## KNOWN GOTCHAS — THINGS THAT HAVE BROKEN BEFORE

### React Hydration Errors (Error #418)
The app has a recurring hydration mismatch. Primary causes:
- **Time-of-day greeting** ("Good Morning/Afternoon/Evening") renders differently on server vs client. Solution: wrap in `useEffect` or use `'use client'` directive with a placeholder on first render.
- **Dynamic dates/timestamps** (e.g. "Suggestions updated 10:09 AM"). Solution: render these client-side only.
- **Calorie goal numbers** that depend on user profile data not yet loaded during SSR. Solution: show skeleton/loading state during SSR, populate client-side.

### Mobile-Specific Issues That Keep Recurring
- **Sidebar doesn't collapse on mobile** — needs hamburger menu toggle at mobile breakpoints. Check after any layout changes.
- **YouTube video embeds disappear on mobile** — the responsive wrapper (position:relative, padding-bottom:56.25%, overflow:hidden) must be present. Parent containers must not have height/width constraints that collapse at small viewports.
- **Barcode scan button should be hidden or show "mobile only" tooltip on desktop** — there's no camera to scan with.

### Habits Section Edge Cases
- When a user has 0 habits configured, the app shows "Perfect day! All habits completed!" — this is wrong. 0 configured habits should show an onboarding prompt, not a congratulation.
- The daily summary counter has shown "You've completed _ out of 0 habits today" (missing number). Ensure the template handles zero/null values.

### Content & Branding
- **Footer year:** Use `new Date().getFullYear()` — never hardcode the year. The app shipped with "© 2025" into 2026.
- **Google Slides embed for Meal Plan Ideas** shows "Made with GAMMA" branding. This undermines professionalism. Plan to replace with native recipe cards.
- **Weight display:** The user's preferred units (metric/imperial) must be respected throughout. South African and UK users expect kg; US users expect lbs. Never assume one system.

