## PROHIBITED ACTIONS

Do NOT do any of the following without explicit owner approval:

1. Modify Supabase RLS policies
2. Change the authentication flow or session handling
3. Delete or restructure the profiles table
4. Switch API providers (e.g. replacing USDA API)
5. Modify environment variables on Vercel
6. Change the deployment branch or build settings
7. Install new major dependencies (minor patches are fine)
8. Overwrite existing user data with empty/null values
9. Remove meal templates without replacement content ready
10. Change the F.R.E.S.H. pillar navigation structure

